{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Napoleonic Wars meet...ducks?</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duckoleon is calling you into battle! Barrage your opponents with cannon and musket fire, Get up close and personal with bayonets, sabres and cavalry, play military instruments like drums or the fife and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.poster.avif?t=1771348180\" width=800 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.webm?t=1771348180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.mp4?t=1771348180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME IS STILL EARLY IN DEVELOPMENT! THERE'S A LOT MORE CONTENT ON THE WAY, THESE ARE ONLY EARLY ACCESS FEATURES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutliple nations  to choose from:</strong> France, Prussia, Great Britain, Habsburg empire, Russia and Kingdom of Italy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of regiments from the Napoleonic Wars</strong> with beautiful uniforms and flags!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different soldier classes with special abilities:</strong>\u00a0fusiliers, grenadiers, light infantry, cavalry ranging from lancers to hussars, artillery, sappers, musical instruments...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple maps inspired by the Napoleonic wars</strong> like Leipzig and Eylau!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A casual mode as well as an organized War mode</strong>\u00a0for larger battles where you can enlist into your favourite regiments and rank your way up to become an officer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of duck, goose and swan breeds</strong>\u00a0like the mallard, northern pintail, pekin and muscovy ducks.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Plunket's duck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775510/16cb6c15f164e73b784e05a5f554cf014b034680.jpg"},{"name":"Grenadier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775510/9fe1078f20ea6442a5c982b11c22ca00fe0f5c36.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775510?t=1771348180","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775510?t=1771348180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/e5ad4d81053bd671c624c1779ad7927550330664/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771348180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/e5ad4d81053bd671c624c1779ad7927550330664/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771348180","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Napoleonic Wars meet...ducks?</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duckoleon is calling you into battle! Barrage your opponents with cannon and musket fire, Get up close and personal with bayonets, sabres and cavalry, play military instruments like drums or the fife and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.poster.avif?t=1771348180\" width=800 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.webm?t=1771348180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.mp4?t=1771348180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME IS STILL EARLY IN DEVELOPMENT! THERE'S A LOT MORE CONTENT ON THE WAY, THESE ARE ONLY EARLY ACCESS FEATURES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutliple nations  to choose from:</strong> France, Prussia, Great Britain, Habsburg empire, Russia and Kingdom of Italy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of regiments from the Napoleonic Wars</strong> with beautiful uniforms and flags!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different soldier classes with special abilities:</strong>\u00a0fusiliers, grenadiers, light infantry, cavalry ranging from lancers to hussars, artillery, sappers, musical instruments...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple maps inspired by the Napoleonic wars</strong> like Leipzig and Eylau!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A casual mode as well as an organized War mode</strong>\u00a0for larger battles where you can enlist into your favourite regiments and rank your way up to become an officer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of duck, goose and swan breeds</strong>\u00a0like the mallard, northern pintail, pekin and muscovy ducks.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Pumancz"],"genres":[{"descri